un**:\n   - User re-ran `desktop_app/app.py` and generated `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\processes\\PROC-001\\results_PROC-001.xlsx`.\n4. **Forensic Audit of Generated Excel (`scratch/inspect_newest_results.py` & `scratch/print_all_current_matches.py`)**:\n   - **Summary Counts**:\n     - Raw shortage requests: 993\n     - Unique shortages: 591\n     - Matched across warehouses: 72 matches (19 in السلام شبين, 17 in المكرومي, 12 in كيور فارما, 6 in مخزن الحياة, 1 in جملة العمرو, 17 in الهضبة).\n     - Needs review: Exactly **6 items** across all warehouses!\n     - Not found: 520 items.\n   - **Needs Review (6 items - 100% Genuine Packaging Discrepancies)**:\n     1. `دوليبران 1000مجم 15قرص` $\\leftrightarrow$ `دوليبيران 1جم، 60قرص` (السلام شبين).\n     2. `جينوفيل 50قرص اوريجنال` $\\leftrightarrow$ `جينوفيل اوريجينال 30 قرص` (المكرومي).\n     3. `تريبليكسام 10/2.5/10مجم 15قرص` $\\leftrightarrow$ `تريبلكسام 10/2.5/10 مجم 30 قرص` (كيور فارما).\n     4. `افيروكوكسيب 90مجم 20قرص` $\\leftrightarrow$ `افيروكوسيب 90مجم 1 قرص` (كيور فارما).\n     5. `افيروكوكسيب 90مجم 20قرص` $\\leftrightarrow$ `افيرو كوكسبيب 90مجم-32ب` (جملة العمرو).\n     6. `دانست 4 مجم 3 امبول` $\\leftrightarrow$ `دانتسيت 4 مج 6 امبول` (الهضبة).\n5. **Synchronized to Production (`dist_production/`)**:\n   - `scripts/package_production.py` ran cleanly.\n\n### In Progress / Pending:\n- **Comprehensive False Negative Scan (النواقص الموجودة بالمخازن ولم تُذكر)**:\n  - Need to run a script comparing the 520 \"Not Found\" shortage items against all 2,717 warehouse catalog entries to check if any real, exact brand/dosage/strength item was accidentally omitted.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n1. **Prompt Generalization Validated**:\n   - Removing `ينسون ايزيس` from the prompt did NOT break the match: `ينسون ايزيس س ج` matched `زيس ينسون` in El-Hadaba naturally via generic OCR tolerance.\n2. **Cream / Ointment Separation Worked**:\n   - `بيتاديرم مرهم` vs `بيتاديرم كريم` in El-Makroumi was correctly eliminated.\n3. **Wholesale Amr (`جملة العمروووو`) Match Recovered**:\n   - Number-spacing fix in `extract_form_group` enabled `امبوفير 5امبول س ج` to match `امبوفير حقن جديد` (1 match, 1 review for Amr).\n4. **Batch Error Handling**:\n   - Batch 3 of El-Hadaba experienced a transient JSON parse glitch on attempt 1/3, but self-healed on attempt 2/3 without losing items.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Workspace**: `d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy`\n- **Output File**: `data/processes/PROC-001/results_PROC-001.xlsx`\n- **Python Executable**: `d:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`\n- **Key modified files**:\n  - `src/fast_match/search.py` (cream/ointment separation, attached number spacing in form extractor).\n  - `src/fast_match/coordinator.py` (clean generic prompt without dataset-specific names).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps (Immediate Action)\n1. **Run a Python Script to Detect Any False Negatives**:\n   - Search through the 520 \"Not Found\" items in `0913.xlsx` against all 6 warehouse catalogs using fuzzy/token matching.\n   - Specifically check if any item sharing brand, form, and strength was missed.\n2. **Compile the Comprehensive Comparative Audit Report for the User**:\n   - Section 1: Comparison table between the previous run and this run (Matches, Reviews, False Positives).\n   - Section 2: Review of the 6 items in `يحتاج مراجعة` (explaining why each is a legitimate packaging difference).\n   - Section 3: Review of the 72 matches across warehouses, noting the positive effect of separating Cream from Ointment.\n   - Section 4: False Negative audit results (whether any shortage was in the warehouses but missed).\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep the prompt generic and abstract (no hardcoded medicine names from the customer's dataset).\n- Maintain strict brand identity, dosage form separation (cream != ointment), and strength match.\n- Deliver clear, well-structured Arabic analysis directly answering the user's 4 points.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the